(62, 'wamid.HBgLOTQ3NzM0MzQ4MzQVAgARGBI0NjFFMDNDRjhEMjhGRTE4MkEA', '94773434834', 'Vvip', 'outgoing', 'text', 'Manual Reply', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Thank you for sharing your requirements.\n\nWe are pleased to inform you that our existing software already covers **most of the features listed in your requirement**, including:\n\n• Dealer-wise outstanding balances\n• Credit limits and credit periods\n• Sales invoices and payment history\n• Stock management for 1L, 500ml and 250ml products\n• Sales returns and damaged stock management\n• Post-dated cheque tracking\n• Customer and dealer payment collections\n• Owner dashboard with sales, stock, outstanding balances and collections\n• Separate restricted login access for office staff\n• Mobile and computer access\n• Excel and PDF reports\n\nThe only requirement that is not currently included in our existing system is the **Courier COD Management module**.\n\nHowever, we can develop and integrate the complete Courier COD module into the existing system within approximately **2 weeks**, including:\n\n• COD order management\n• Waybill number tracking\n• COD pending settlement tracking\n• Received payment management\n• Returned parcel management\n• Courier-wise settlement tracking\n• COD reports and reconciliation\n\nSince most of your requirements are already available in our existing system, the implementation can be completed much faster and more efficiently than developing a completely new system from the beginning.\n\nWe would be happy to demonstrate the existing system and discuss any small adjustments required to match your exact business process.', 'read', '693326623870717', '2026-09-25 06:40:27', '2026-09-25 06:40:27', '{\"source\":\"whatsapp_inbox\",\"api_response\":{\"messaging_product\":\"whatsapp\",\"contacts\":[{\"input\":\"94773434834\",\"wa_id\":\"94773434834\"}],\"messages\":[{\"id\":\"wamid.HBgLOTQ3NzM0MzQ4MzQVAgARGBI0NjFFMDNDRjhEMjhGRTE4MkEA\"}]}}', '2026-09-25 06:40:27', '2026-09-25 06:52:19'),
